<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LCCA Panel - {{ student.name }}</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f4f6f9, #e9ecef); 
            height: 100vh; 
            margin: 0; 
            display: flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            justify-content: center; 
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            border-top: 6px solid #6f42c1;
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
        }
        h1 { color: #333; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; }
        p { color: #666; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .icon { font-size: 60px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="icon">🚧</div>
        <h1>Witaj, {{ student.name }}</h1>
        <p>Platforma edukacyjna LCCA jest jeszcze w budowie.</p>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; color: #6f42c1;">Wróć tu niedługo!</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
